            "locale": "en_us",
            "response": "Thank you for the 5-star review! We’re glad the home was perfect for your girls’ trip and that the proximity to the tennis courts, beach, and shops made things easy. We enjoyed hosting you and look forward to your return to 30A Luxury Vacations.",
