            "id": "a6998d29-4160-423c-8750-3b8ca3aa01d6",
            "locale": "en_US",
            "response": "Thank you for the kind words! We look forward to welcoming you back.",
            "user": "VrboOwner"
          }
        ],
        "text": "Rating Details:\nThe property manager was very helpful.\nThe vacation rental was spotless.\nI was very happy with the location.\nI was more than satisfied with the condition of the vacation rental.\nOverall, I recommend this vacation rental.\n\nReviewer Comments:\nAll was wonderful with this house and the locations!l",
        "title": "Awesome"
      },
      {
        "author": "Meredith C.",
        "date": "2025-05-26T13:13:33Z",
        "id": "683477181e602e05c75d9721",
        "label": "Excellent",
        "locale": "en_US",
        "rating": 10,
        "text": "Loved the location of this house -- easy walk to the beach and restaurants (Donut Hole, Shades, etc). Beds and linens were very comfortable (so happy about that!) and there was plenty of space for us. Kitchen was pretty well stocked and the outside grill was nice, keep in mind you'll need to buy or bring all seasonings that you need if you plan on cooking like we did. We also couldn't get the dish washer to work but that could have been user error (didn't ask management, we hand washed everything). All in all very happy with our stay and we hope to use the property again next year!",
        "themes": [
          "Liked: Cleanliness, check-in, communication, location, listing accuracy"
        ],
        "title": "Great location, good for large groups.",
        "verified": true
      },
      {
        "author": "Renato S.",
        "date": "2025-03-21T07:34:00Z",
        "id": "67deae1e5a34f26b0e7affdd",
        "label": "Good",
        "locale": "en_US",
        "rating": 8,
        "responses": [
          {
            "date": "Apr 15, 2025",
            "id": "70a6517f-d798-49f0-8b4c-e6a04ee4b5f8",
            "locale": "en_US",
            "response": "Thank you for your feedback. We're glad to hear you had a good stay overall, but we’re sorry about the cleanliness and maintenance concerns you experienced. We always aim to provide a high standard and are happy to have housekeeping or maintenance assist with any issues if they’re brought to our attention during your stay. Your input is appreciated, and we’ll be following up with our team to ensure these items are addressed.",
            "user": "VrboOwner"
          }
        ],
        "text": "Rating Details:\nThe property manager was very helpful.\nThe vacation rental was clean.\nI was very happy with the location.\nI was more than satisfied with the condition of the vacation rental.\nOverall, I recommend this vacation rental.\n\nReviewer Comments:\nEverything was very good only that when we arrived at the house it was not very clean and there was a lot of sand almost all over the house mainly on the first floor, the vacuum cleaner they have in the house for daily vacuuming does not suck well, there was no lemon squeezer, the door plate of the backyard was broken, and I think that the cleaning fee they charge us is too high for the house not to be completely clean when we arrived.",
        "title": "Great Location Home in Rosemary Beach"
      },
      {
        "author": "Cindy S.",
        "date": "2025-07-14T08:50:00Z",
        "id": "68764d67a677322af0cb1518",
        "label": "Excellent",
        "locale": "en_US",
        "rating": 10,
        "responses": [
          {
            "date": "Sep 24, 2025",
            "id": "95137b3a-66f1-4bec-a323-abdd82a547a2",
            "locale": "en_US",
            "response": "Thank you so much for your thoughtful review. We're glad the home worked well for your group and that you enjoyed the amenities and convenient location. We're also happy to hear our team was able to address the maintenance concerns quickly during your stay.\n\nWe appreciate your suggestion about adding more living room seating—it's a great point, especially for larger groups—and we’ll be sure to pass that along to the team for consideration. We hope to welcome you back again soon!",
            "user": "VrboOwner"
          }
        ],
        "text": "Rating Details:\nThe property manager was very helpful.\nThe vacation rental was spotless.\nI was very happy with the location.\nI was very satisfied with the condition of the vacation rental.\nOverall, I recommend this vacation rental.\n\nReviewer Comments:\nThis home is perfect for large groups and extended families, with more than enough room to spread out. The pool and outdoor shower were put to good use and the walk to the beach was easy for all of our party. We did have issues with hot water, a chirping smoke detector and wasps, and all of these were handled quickly and efficiently. My only recommendation would be more seating in the living room so large groups can gather. Since this property sleeps so many, an appropriate seating arrangement would be nice.",
        "title": "Highly Recommend"
      }
    ],
